{"name":"Ballroom Belle","hex":"#dad3c8","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"ballroom","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A large room used for dancing and banquets.","A type of elegant dance."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To take part in ballroom dancing."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/ballroom"},{"term":"belle","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An attractive woman.","A fellow gay man."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/belle"}],"entries":[{"title":"Ballroom","blocks":[{"text":"A ballroom or ballhall is a large room for holding large formal parties called balls. Traditionally, most balls were held in private residences; many mansions and palaces, especially historic mansions and palaces, contain one or more ballrooms. In other large houses, a large room such as the main drawing room, long gallery, or hall may double as a ballroom, but a good ballroom should have the right type of flooring, such as hardwood flooring or stone flooring .. For most styles of modern dance, a wooden sprung floor offers the best surface."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ef/Catherine_Palace_ballroom.jpg/330px-Catherine_Palace_ballroom.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ballroom","wikidata":"Q805353"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/15/Oranjezaal_na_de_restauratie-_overzicht_noordoosthoek%2C_met_de_hele_oostwand_-_%27s-Gravenhage_-_20416714_-_RCE.jpg/500px-Oranjezaal_na_de_restauratie-_overzicht_noordoosthoek%2C_met_de_hele_oostwand_-_%27s-Gravenhage_-_20416714_-_RCE.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/15/Oranjezaal_na_de_restauratie-_overzicht_noordoosthoek%2C_met_de_hele_oostwand_-_%27s-Gravenhage_-_20416714_-_RCE.jpg/1280px-Oranjezaal_na_de_restauratie-_overzich